  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">이지메이커 공기압센서를 활용하여</span><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">기체의 부피와 압력 사이의 관계를 실험해 보았어요</span><br>&#160;<br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">코딩은 아래처럼 하고요</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/70c70226e050f483e0914a2b5e059a0663c5019a\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"500\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/70c70226e050f483e0914a2b5e059a0663c5019a\" data-origin-width=\"630\" data-origin-height=\"295\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>&#160;<br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">공기압센서를 보드에 연결합니다.</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c35e552e984195fb6e225102e241798a8f82a26b\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c35e552e984195fb6e225102e241798a8f82a26b\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"435\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/844b47e2140c342400bb5b9089cb7d2eec4bd338\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/844b47e2140c342400bb5b9089cb7d2eec4bd338\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"435\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/da26398e15a992e195a04011fe4afb94bb4bcf11\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/da26398e15a992e195a04011fe4afb94bb4bcf11\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"435\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3c8fd8887948cef4b57ab90276399a019b1f6445\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3c8fd8887948cef4b57ab90276399a019b1f6445\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"773\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">그리고</span><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">주사기를 8ml, 6ml, 4ml, 2ml 크기가 되도록</span><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">주사기에 힘을 가합니다.</span><br>&#160;<br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">그때 주사기 안의 공기의 압력을 공기압센서로 측정하는 것이죠</span><br>&#160;<br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">데이터를 아래 엑셀파일입니다</span></p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1fbc6bd3c4e154354520ba9a3650fa281a762a5c?download\" data-file-name=\"data_20250625_144358.csv\" data-file-size=\"5228\" data-mimetype=\"text/csv\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHq%26dataid%3D692%26fileid%3D7%26regdt%3D20250626103407&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F1fbc6bd3c4e154354520ba9a3650fa281a762a5c')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">data_20250625_144358</span><span class=\"type\">.csv</span></div><div class=\"size\">5.11KB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0e24ea7fb35bf87f416b84e40c6db08309a426b1\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0e24ea7fb35bf87f416b84e40c6db08309a426b1\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"378\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">시간에 따른 주사기속 압력값입니다.</span><br>&#160;<br><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">주사기 속 공기압의 평균값과 주사기의 부피 입니다</span></span></p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table data-ke-type=\"table\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\" style=\"width: 100%;\" border=\"1\" data-ke-style=\"style0\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">압력 P (hPa)</span></span></td><td style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">부피 V (ml)</span></span></td><td style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">PV= C</span></span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">1029.57158</span></span></td><td style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">8</span></span></td><td style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">8236.57263</span></span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">1364.731</span></span></td><td style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">6</span></span></td><td style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">8188.386</span></span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">1978.94375</span></span></td><td style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">4</span></span></td><td style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">7915.775</span></span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">3292.75857</span></span></td><td style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">2</span></span></td><td style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">6585.51714</span></span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">2ml 부피를 가질때 압력을 지속적으로 강하게 주지 못하여</span><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">압력이 점점 낮아짐이 그래프상에서 보입니다</span><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">(위 그래프를 보면 서서히 압력이 내려가는 것)</span><br>&#160;<br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">그로인해 </span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">PV= C의 평균값이 다른값에 비해 낮습니다.</span></span><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">hPa단위가 아닌</span> <span data-ke-size=\"size18\">1기압(atm) 단위로 데이터를 수집하면,<br>보다 더 나을 것 같은 생각이<br>이지메이커에서 수집할때 설정을 atm단위로 설정 가능합니다.<br><br></span><br><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
